{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/qr5007","slide":3,"text":"This method map is meant to keep the identification logic very clear. RQ1 asks what changes when we move from a human-only environment to an AI-supported decision environment. RQ2 isolates the confirmation condition, which is about human passage and ownership. RQ3 isolates disclosure, which is about visibility and responsibility sharing. RQ4 then asks whether changes in responsibility perceptions are aligned with changes in escalation. This keeps the method claim narrow and defensible."}